# Eval harness output (manager guideline regression runs): per-case actual
# recs + judge samples land here under out/eval/<guidelines_hash>/. Re-runs
# are content-addressed by hash, so the dir grows quickly and is not
# something we want to commit (the cases under tests/manager_cases/ are
# the corpus; this is just the per-run output).
out/
# Defensive: the supervisor's allowlist lives at ~/.ai-harness/active-dirs.txt
# (per-user, per-host, names private app dirs). If a misconfigured `cp` or
# `git add -A` ever pulls it back into the repo, this rule blocks it.
/active-dirs.txt
.DS_Store
